### 1. STAFF CONFIRMS a Pending reservation: r2 (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### 2. Confirm r2 again (expect 400: Confirmed -> Confirmed not allowed)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### 3. STAFF REJECTS a Pending reservation: r3 (expect 200, cancelledBy "staff")
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled",
  "reason": "Function area closed for a private event"
}

### 4. Try to confirm the rejected r3 (expect 400: Cancelled is final)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### 5. STAFF COMPLETES r6, a past Confirmed reservation (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r6/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 6. Complete r1 before its date (expect 400: too early)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 7. Change a Completed reservation: r5 (expect 400: Completed is final)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r5/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}

### 8. Invalid status value (expect 400)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### 9. CUSTOMER CANCELS their Confirmed reservation: r1 (expect 200, cancelledBy "customer")
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Change of plans"
}

### 10. Table 5 is now FREE on Oct 10, 7 PM (expect count 7: Table 5 is back)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/availability?date=2026-10-10&time=19:00&guests=4

### 11. Cancel r1 again (expect 400: already Cancelled)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Again"
}

### 12. Reservation that does not exist (expect 404)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r999/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### 13. All Cancelled reservations (expect count 3: r1, r3, r4)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reservations?status=Cancelled
